<DocsLayout title="Testing Webhooks with Hookdeck | Echophi Docs" description="Use Hookdeck to inspect and debug Echophi webhook payloads during development.">
  <h1>Testing with Hookdeck</h1>
  <p>
    Use Hookdeck (or similar) as a durable inspector in front of your CRM URL. Register the Hookdeck source URL as
    the Partner webhook endpoint, verify HMAC, then forward to your app.
